<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ aims to remove all tariffs by 2010 - Peters.</title>
<headline>NZ aims to remove all tariffs by 2010 - Peters.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand aims to remove all tariffs by well witin the APEC dealine of 2010, Treasurer Winston Peters said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The 1998 tariff Review will set a timetable to remove all remaining tariffs well within the 2010 deadline set by APEC,&quot; Peters said in his budget speech.</p>
<p>Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
